{
    "attributes": {
        "action": "Exempt those involved in the killing of emergency workers from early release.",
        "additional_details": "Persons who are sentenced to a term of imprisonment, by a Court of Law, for any part played in the killing of an on duty emergency worker should complete the whole sentence, as passed, and not be eligible for early release.",
        "background": "Any person involved, in any way, directly or indirectly, in the killing of an emergency worker should be exempt from early release from prison and should complete the sentence as passed by a court of law.",
